# Smoke test for GalleryGtk: the text input page (focus, typing, fill by form label). Shots in /tmp/shots.
waitfor Text input
tap Text input
waitfor Name
tap Name
keys Ada Lovelace
expect Hello, Ada Lovelace
fill URL|https://v57.dev
expect https://v57.dev
screenshot /tmp/shots/gallery-text.png
dump /tmp/shots/gallery-text.txt
back
waitfor Animation
exit
